Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,{Lalalalaing}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:06.65,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:07.45,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:07.99,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:09.03,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.03,0:00:09.57,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:10.32,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,A monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:11.20,Default,Randgramps1,0,0,0,,Or a giant flying squirrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:11.82,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:12.99,Default,Rand4,0,0,0,,No, it's just a cute girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:14.54,Default,Rand5,0,0,0,,Just what you were hoping for...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:15.58,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:16.04,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:16.96,Default,Rand1243,0,0,0,,It's actually a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:17.66,Default,Rand234,0,0,0,,A child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:18.46,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:19.37,Default,Randgramps1,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:20.21,Default,Rand4,0,0,0,,That's too high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:21.46,Default,Rand5,0,0,0,,Come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:22.75,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:29.38,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:31.47,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm looking for something!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.47,0:00:33.35,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But I can't seem to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.35,0:00:35.06,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,It's dangerous up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:37.10,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It feels great up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:38.77,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Why don't you come up here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.77,0:00:40.19,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.19,0:00:42.48,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,C-Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:44.40,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.61,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Look that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:46.36,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:47.07,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:47.82,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:48.82,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.66,0:00:54.12,Default,Principal,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],You won this time, Rina{-chan}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Default,Tel,0,0,0,,{[TEL]}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:58.58,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Th-That sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:00.29,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Glo!{part of her name... really...}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:06.21,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,It's a call from him!{do I want to do desuwa..?}{方 refers to people, not objects}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.67,0:01:10.09,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:13.09,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Madame Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.43,0:01:16.31,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,I-It has been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.06,0:01:19.85,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I've found the ideal princess candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.85,0:01:22.40,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Huh? The ideal princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.40,0:01:24.81,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,W-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:26.90,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,The one who shall claim victory in the Grand Prix,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:29.69,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,and ride atop the lead float in the Dream Parade...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:32.03,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,...is PriPara's ideal princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.66,0:01:35.74,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I believe she should be arriving there shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.74,0:01:38.95,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'll be leaving her in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:43.92,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Why did you come to Parajuku?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.92,0:01:46.13,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,My prince asked me to{orig: asked me to}.{I was given an invitation by the prince.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.13,0:01:48.84,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Y-Your prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:51.92,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yes, he's a truly wonderful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:54.84,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,You know, I can't see forests or lakes here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:57.60,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,but I've always dreamed of living{orig: wanted} a city life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:01:58.81,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,[hard to read?],I'm going to enjoy it to the fullest!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:02:00.35,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:05.98,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,3775)}Yoohoo!{echo!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:39.62,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Fuwari, the girl from the Palps!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:49.04,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,A princess candidate is coming here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:50.38,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}What should I do? What should I do?{どうしましょったらどうしましょ the lit is more like If she does what should I do}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:52.50,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}What should I do? What should I do?{どうしましょったらどうしましょ the lit is more like If she does what should I do}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:54.46,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Anyway, I should head out to greet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.84,0:03:56.30,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:58.43,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Yes, good aftern—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:00.39,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:01.64,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:03.68,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,What's with the goat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.89,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,We became friends on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.89,0:04:07.81,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Take off your hat when you're inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.81,0:04:10.06,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Ah, pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:12.77,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,But why do you have a goat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:17.28,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,This is an introduction letter from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:20.74,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,You're the ideal princess candidate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.03,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:24.33,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm Midorikaze Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:25.95,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:27.21,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:28.92,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:34.88,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,PriPara's ideal princess who will ride\N atop the lead float in the Dream Parade?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:42.68,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's... She's this girl that smells like goat mixed with grass, acorns, mushrooms, and deer droppings?!{it's like how could the ideal princess candidate be this girl that... blah}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:45.31,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do remember him saying something about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:48.35,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure there must be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:50.10,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:53.40,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,This mountain smell that clings to you, I, Ookanda Gloria, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:54.40,Default,Principal,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Rina{-chan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:58.32,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,...will cleanse you of it.{ordering fucks this line}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.74,0:05:06.24,Default,Rina,0,0,0,,Here at Paprika Academy, you shall receive training that will take you from zero to being the ideal princess.{Here at Paprika Academy you shall receive training from zero to become the ideal princess.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.41,Default-Alt,Rina,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.41,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:09.71,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:10.25,Default-Alt,Principal [overlap 340ms],0,0,0,,Spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:13.50,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Big news!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:18.21,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,The PriPara princess scholarship\N student is transferring in today!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:19.97,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Princess scholarship student?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.97,0:05:22.80,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's the talk of the school!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:24.68,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,I wonder what she's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:26.31,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:28.47,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Her name's Midorikaze Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:31.94,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,She's from the Palps; a mountainous area in EuroPara. {Do they seriously not know what the Alps are?? What are they learning in this school?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.94,0:05:33.86,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Of course you'd know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:35.98,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,She's a second year in middle school,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:40.07,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,but she's given special permission to live{orig: supposed to be living} in the Paprika Academy High School dorms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.07,0:05:42.15,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:43.49,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Unprecedented!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.49,0:05:45.07,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Wait, we have a high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:46.95,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,And dorms?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:49.00,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We do.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.41,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,They've been around for quite some time.{We've had one for a long time.}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.41,0:05:52.87,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,They're behind the gymnasium.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:55.04,Default,Lerla,0,0,0,,Really? That's news to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:57.25,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,How careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.25,0:06:00.26,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I couldn't read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.26,0:06:03.76,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,But living in the dorms sounds fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:06.47,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I should mention: Ms. Ookanda is the headmistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:08.01,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,On second thought, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:11.02,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Princess scholarship student, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:17.02,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,She'll be the center of attention in the\Nupcoming Summer Dream Idol Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:20.15,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Will she be a rival? Or a partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:24.86,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,We don't know yet, but let us {orig: Since we don't know, we better }{put all our }focus on PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:26.20,Default,Lethy,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:28.33,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Same goes for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.33,0:06:30.95,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's search for our next teammates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:33.58,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,...is what I'd like to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:36.42,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,but I also have work I need to do\N as the student council president.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:39.71,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I have to go meet the princess scholarship student now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:41.21,Default,Laphy,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:46.43,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Wow, we really do have a high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.43,0:06:48.35,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You don't have to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:49.81,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,But I wanna meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:52.06,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It would be rude if I didn't meet her fully dressed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:56.35,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Since she's the princess scholarship student, \NI bet she'll look kinda like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.35,0:06:57.77,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,She's so sparkly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:01.78,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Midorikaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:06.95,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Why are you sleeping there?{in a spot like that?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:13.41,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Good morning, Ms. Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.83,0:07:16.96,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,That bed is far too soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:20.46,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,In the Palps, we'd always sleep on straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:21.59,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,You mustn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:23.84,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,You need to behave{orig: act} like a princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.84,0:07:27.09,Default-Alt,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's hard to move around in those pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:27.09,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Ah! It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:29.43,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh, you're the girl from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:31.51,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh? You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:32.97,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Yeah, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:36.73,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,It's nice to properly meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.73,0:07:38.35,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,I'm Manaka Laala.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:41.94,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm the Student Council President \Nand Head Disciplinarian, Minami Mirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:44.57,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix],I'm Houjou Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.57,0:07:46.90,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm a reincarnation of a jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:48.49,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.49,0:07:52.03,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm aiming to be PriPara's ideal princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:55.41,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,How much longer do you plan on being in your pajamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.33,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Hurry up and change into your school uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:58.83,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll be fine in this instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.71,0:08:04.26,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,This is easier to move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:06.22,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Ah! H-H-H-Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:19.60,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Ms. Gloria, may I take this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:24.48,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,In the Palps, it was only the cows \Nand goats who wore collars.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:25.99,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,That's a neck tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:28.24,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Please! It's suffocating!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:28.86,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:29.82,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:32.95,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Paprika Academy rule number 754:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:35.66,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,"Students must address their teachers with respect"!{lit with an honorific}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:38.83,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,[unreadable!],I'm sorry to do this right after you've changed schools,\nbut I'm issuing your first insubordination ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:42.88,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Now that I get a better look at you,\Nyou look just like one of my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:44.42,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh? Friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:50.89,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Just like Komugi's tail and her cute behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.89,0:08:52.72,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{Sound of shock}Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:54.60,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Rule number 43:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:57.43,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,"Don't say that someone looks like a horse's butt"!{is someone keeping track of these? If not, someone should.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Default,Goat,0,0,0,,{Meh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:02.77,Default,Milapal,0,0,0,,Waa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.19,0:09:05.23,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Default,Goat,0,0,0,,{moar goat}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:07.82,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.82,0:09:09.74,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,School's going to be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:14.58,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.07,0:09:14.24,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Fuwari seems like a really fun person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:18.00,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Fuwari, get back here and accept your second ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:18.00,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah, a goat's friend is a friend of mine.{ my friend as well.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:21.71,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,I can understand how she felt earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{I can't fuckin make out anything other than like that's against the rules}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.71,0:09:24.46,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,but with my unrelenting guidance,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:27.92,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,she'll surely become the ideal princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.26,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Right, Rina dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.97,0:09:34.64,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,Let's see, Midorikaze will sit...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:38.60,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,Ah, there's no one sitting next to Dorothy West.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:41.85,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is the princess candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:47.98,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh well, if I get along with her,\Nmaybe she'll join our five-person team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.98,0:09:49.03,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.03,0:09:50.07,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:53.36,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,If you're a princess, then I'm a queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:54.91,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,so you can call me "Your Highness".{Jyou}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.33,0:09:57.95,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's got a tablet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.95,0:10:00.91,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's got a lot of nerve for a middle schooler!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.83,0:10:02.79,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.79,0:10:05.96,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Wait. Is that a mini chalkboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:08.96,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's because the goat will eat my paper...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:10.30,Default,Goat,0,0,0,,Baa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.51,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Baa"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:14.26,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That's my notebook!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:16.76,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,She said it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:18.93,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:21.06,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,She's the super worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:24.40,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's only been one day, but it's already been max craziness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:27.65,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Don't eat my test too!{orig: It even ate my test!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.65,0:10:28.82,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,She said it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:32.53,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What are you fishing in the pool for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.53,0:10:33.86,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:36.07,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,And when I wanted to eat my lunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:37.62,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{# Isn't it obvious that she's milking her goat?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:38.99,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Milking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.58,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, baby birdy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:46.21,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Don't go and hatch birds on my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:49.42,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It was infuriating! {so frustrating!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.63,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,In what universe is she princess-y?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.63,0:10:53.34,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Calm down, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:54.93,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Relax. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.18,0:10:58.14,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Well, I can sympathize with Dorothy's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:00.68,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,With one wrong step, freedom becomes selfishness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.68,0:11:01.97,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Just like Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:03.89,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,More like ego!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:08.02,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,She thinks she can get away with anything \Njust because she might win!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:08.86,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:13.65,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,With the way things are going, I wonder if\NFuwari will get used to school and PriPara...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:15.32,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You're worried, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:19.62,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,I was just talking about you, Fuwari!{could use Speak of the devil, but I think I used that with someone talking about Aroma and I don't want to repeat that to a "non-demon"}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:20.66,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:21.87,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.87,0:11:24.00,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,What are you looking for this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.29,0:11:25.83,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:28.21,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I made a promise with my prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:36.18,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}PriPara is a wonderful place overflowing with dreams, aspirations, and other beautiful things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.51,0:11:41.64,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you become the ideal princess in PriPara for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:43.10,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:45.52,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, I'd be glad to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:50.11,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of place PriPara is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:51.73,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I can't wait to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:53.28,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Then let's go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:53.94,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:59.16,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Hello, Ms. Meganee!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:01.74,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Ah, you have a new face with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:03.41,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Did you bring your PriTicket with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:05.37,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,This, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.75,0:12:07.87,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,My prince told me about it.{this is the prince's ticket... who is probalby actually a girl... I'm calling it now.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:10.67,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Then let's pick out your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:12.46,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What's a coord?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:15.05,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,She's searching for the brand that best fits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:17.51,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of coord would look best on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:21.43,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The perfect brand for you is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:26.77,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Th-There isn't one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:27.14,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:27.98,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:28.60,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.23,0:12:31.48,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.49,0:12:43.24,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,What do you mean there isn't a brand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.78,0:12:47.29,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,For some reason I can't find a coord that would fit her perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:50.54,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This is the first time something like this has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:52.04,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:55.71,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I'll make a new brand that suits you on the double.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:59.05,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,In the meantime, how about...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.10,0:13:07.22,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please deal with these clothes for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.15,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,I'm Laala.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.15,0:13:12.40,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What?! {goat sounds}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.27,0:13:17.40,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Since her brand registration hasn't been completed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:19.50,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,she can't enter any shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:21.49,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Really? Isn't there anything you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:22.95,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,That's how the system works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:33.00,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Man, I wanted to do a show in cute coords with Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.00,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:36.92,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:38.01,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:41.26,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,This is PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:45.80,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's just like he described!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:48.22,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,PriPara is a wonderful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.22,0:13:50.81,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,I'm glad you think it's so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.81,0:13:51.73,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:55.23,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,There's more places I wanna show you over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:13:57.65,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Come on! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:02.49,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.49,0:14:04.99,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,There's so much greenery and flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:08.16,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The air smells just like it does in Palps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.87,0:14:09.87,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:14.88,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Here I was drinking vegetable juice in a place like this,\N and then you had to go and do that-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:17.34,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,My precious vegetable juice...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:20.21,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I spilled 350ml of it-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:21.80,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:23.76,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Don't think you can just get off with an "I'm sorry"!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:26.93,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Hand over enough to fill a bathtub to show you're sorry-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:28.35,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You rooster...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.35,0:14:29.18,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:33.73,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Ku...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:34.98,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.98,0:14:36.98,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,What a refreshing smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:41.40,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,More like I've been healed by\N a soft breeze across the plains-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:45.41,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm surprised to see a cute girl such as yourself here in PriPara-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.37,0:14:49.03,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,It seems Kuma has also taken a liking to you, Fuwari.{Laala don't encourage him.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:49.74,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:51.75,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Is this a friend of yours, Laala?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.75,0:14:53.75,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Who is this girl-kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:54.62,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,What's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:55.58,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,What year?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:57.08,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Blood type?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:14:59.34,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,What's her type? Could it be a bear like me?{No, she likes GNC non-binary princes and magic Vocaloids. also you're gross}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:02.21,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Type? A bear might be too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:03.80,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Fuwari?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.80,0:15:05.26,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:09.30,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Attention idols,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.30,0:15:14.81,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,we'll be switching the hologrammation to artificial rain to water the flowers and greenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:16.40,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This was the system.
Comment: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:18.27,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,[notanemdash],Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:19.15,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.15,0:15:20.52,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,I'm getting all wet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:23.24,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,Let's wait in the café until it stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:24.45,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.45,0:15:26.95,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What are you doing out there-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.95,0:15:29.49,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,I got separated from Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:30.24,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:31.74,Default,Mirela,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:48.68,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What beautiful flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:51.01,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,And the rain feels great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:15:59.06,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Fuwari?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:07.95,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Halt, my servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.07,0:16:32.43,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Wowzers! She's got such a big audience!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:36.02,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,One must fear those who \Nhold the power to manipulate animals!{Ye must fear the one who holds the power to manipulate animals!}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:37.77,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan wants to be her friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:40.73,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the power of the princess candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.73,0:16:44.73,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}She has a charm that's different than any other girl-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:46.82,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we form a five person team with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:50.95,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure we'll be able to sweep the\NSummer Dream Idol Grand Prix-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.95,0:16:53.16,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:00.87,Default,Rand,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:02.58,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:05.09,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,That was incredible, Fuwari!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.09,0:17:07.88,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Your voice is clearer than a jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.88,0:17:09.80,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Even your impromptu show is great-pri.{Not sure how exactly to handle that "grass show". My first instinct was "guerilla show" but that sounds a little dramatic. It's just referring to the fact she's doing it in a field so maybe "lawn show"? - krym}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:11.80,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.80,0:17:13.01,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:14.64,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What do you mean "show"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:16.10,Default,All,0,0,0,,{No way!}{as they crash}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.02,0:17:19.43,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,That's right. You've always lived in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:21.69,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,You've never seen a show before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.69,0:17:23.19,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Would you show her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.19,0:17:25.15,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Who? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.15,0:17:27.57,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Easier said than done...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.57,0:17:30.78,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'd love to see Laala's show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:34.16,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Just get out there and show her-pri.{I think this capture the essence of the whole sentence by itself. - krym}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:35.58,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:36.70,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:41.96,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.17,0:17:45.38,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:51.59,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,An image of a sparkling hydrangea wet with rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:54.01,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The sheer frills are quite elegant!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:55.51,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Hydrangea Bouquet Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:13.97,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:15.68,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Princess...{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:17.22,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Princess, where are you-kuma?!!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:20.60,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:22.93,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Flower garden in full bloom!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:24.23,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,For you!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:28.40,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Lovely Flower Cinderella!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:30.23,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.11,0:19:33.99,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:22.53,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was wonderful, Laala.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:23.99,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.99,0:20:25.75,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:28.25,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to debut as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.25,0:20:30.88,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}And become the ideal princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:35.92,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Laala, that was really, really wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:37.59,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:38.76,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,All right, let's snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:39.38,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:46.22,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,How the heck did you snap cheese?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:48.52,Default,Sohpie,0,0,0,,It's authentic Palps cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:51.48,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,This is how you exchange Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:53.94,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Let's do a concert together someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:55.11,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.19,0:20:59.11,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,At this time, the rain will stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:21:00.99,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This was the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:10.54,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, my prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:15.46,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,[double word: to],{\i1}I'll make sure to become a princess worthy of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.18,0:21:24.39,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Madame Gloria,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:28.27,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'll be arriving shortly as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.03,0:23:07.24,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,My prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.24,0:23:10.37,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to become a beautiful princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.37,0:23:12.79,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I look forward to it, my princess.{待遠しいよ}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.79,0:23:15.96,Default,Laala,0,0,0,,Why has Fuwari's prince come to Paprika Academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:18.92,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I want to sing at PriPara soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.92,0:23:21.67,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,We'll help you search for a manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.67,0:23:25.72,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We'll make Fuwari our friend and be the next ones to do the Grand Prix. {The Grand Prix is the 5-man thing right? I'm getting confused now because of the season coord crap - krym}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.72,0:23:27.47,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.89,0:23:28.89,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.89,0:23:31.89,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince and the Blue Bird of Sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.89,0:23:33.22,Default,All,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:35.02,Default,All,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
